# Following an external clock (EXT): MIDI Start (FA) from the TRS jack starts the piece, each clock pulse (F8) is 40
# ticks, the clock runs between pulses at the last beat's rate (24 pulses 20 ms apart: 2 ticks per ms, 125 BPM) and
# never past the next pulse. The pulses stop (a router unplugged): after 500 ms the clock runs on at the same rate,
# playing; MIDI Stop (FC) stops it. Clock from USB is not followed while the input is TRS alone, and nothing of the
# clock goes out (the FM-1 never sends a clock it follows).
rt sync ext
rt port TRS
midi USB F8
wait 10
midi USB F8
wait 10
midi TRS FA
expect playing 1
expect tick 0
wait 18
midi TRS F8
wait 18
midi TRS F8
wait 18
midi TRS F8
wait 18
midi TRS F8
wait 18
midi TRS F8
wait 18
